    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70e6a3d890202800",
      "translationZh": "GPT-5.6 Sol、Terra、Luna 在智能水平与成本方面的比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3230b5883a682461",
      "translationZh": "在智能水平与每项任务成本的对比图上，GPT-5.6 Sol 和 Luna 在每个点上都领先于 Terra。GPT-5.6 Luna 尤为突出，是一款成本效益特别高的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6b30e1fa272798d",
      "translationZh": "将 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 绘制成图，可以看出智能水平与每项智能指数任务成本之间的权衡。在不同推理强度下，每款 GPT-5.6 模型都在帕累托前沿上超越了 GPT-5.5（不包括非推理模式）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56f06dbcb6ef0629",
      "translationZh": "不过，Luna 和 Sol 始终领先于 Terra。这意味着，对于 Terra 的任何推理强度，都有一种 Luna 或 Sol 的推理强度，能以相同或更低的成本提供更高的智能水平，或者以更低的成本提供相同的智能水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b9f8cd160a858ba",
      "translationZh": "前往 https://artificialanalysis.ai，将 GPT-5.6 Sol、Terra 和 Luna 与其他领先模型进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d024a498b9be246d",
      "translationZh": "发布 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b57f1cb8b5ffa880",
      "translationZh": "我们正通过阶段性更新，提前推出即将发布的 v5 中的部分内容，以跟上前沿进展。指数 v4.2 包含更复杂、更贴近现实的任务，以及更多私有测试集，以防止针对评测投机取巧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b2a47bb49b68e45c",
      "translationZh": "对 GPT-6 Astra 进行基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cce9780248374b28",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Astra 在 Artificial Analysis 编程智能体指数中取得显著进步，以更低的成本获得了与 Fable 5 相同的分数。在智能指数中，它使用比 GPT-5.6 Sol 更少的 token 达到了相近的表现，但更高的价格抵消了这一优势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d63bbfaacfdd01d9",
      "translationZh": "Muse Spark 1.3：Meta 跻身前沿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
